---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import mentorPhoto from "../../images/about3.webp";
---

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:gap-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div data-reveal>
      <h2 class="headline text-white">Mentorship</h2>
      <p class="copy mt-6 max-w-xl">
        Mentors are a fundamental part of QP, providing teams with advice and
        guidance through the ideation and execution of their project. Each team
        is paired with a mentor they can regularly consult for advice and
        insights. Mentors are matched with teams based on their expertise and
        the team’s project focus, ensuring aligned support for each group.
      </p>
      <p class="copy mt-5 max-w-xl">
        If you are interested in becoming a mentor, please follow this link to
        signup:
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://forms.gle/pAVXShHpPHMdmnQg9"
        target="_blank"
        class="ieee-btn ieee-btn-ghost mt-8"
      >
        BECOME A MENTOR
      </a>
    </div>
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-ieee-blue-100/15"
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay: 80ms"
    >
      <Image
        src={mentorPhoto}
        alt="blue background"
        width={1200}
        class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
